  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing and embedding an NDC Capital Raising Strategy for Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support increased institutional capacity of domestic institutions to plan for, mobilise and access private and public capital in support of national climate ambitions through developing an NDC Capital Raising Strategy, supporting its uptake and use through capacity building and developing financing partnerships with international financial institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vivid Economics is leading a project idea to develop a private financing strategy for priority NDCs in Peru. This would involve analysis of mitigation and adaptation measures, investment envirnment and strategy for connection with capital investment opportunities. This would also involve a training and awareness raising component for public and private sector actors.</narrative>
  </description>
